WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.384 --> 00:00:01.368
(contemplative strings music)

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.635
- [Narrator] Some people say it smells

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:07.405
like decaying garbage or
rotten meat or smelly feet.

00:00:07.405 --> 00:00:09.655
But nope, it's stinky tofu.

00:00:12.036 --> 00:00:13.543
(water splashing)

00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:15.411
Stinky tofu has been fermented

00:00:15.411 --> 00:00:17.472
and gives off an intense smell.

00:00:17.472 --> 00:00:20.177
While mostly found as a
street food throughout China,

00:00:20.177 --> 00:00:24.344
here in Taipei, one woman
has given the stink a home.

00:00:53.591 --> 00:00:57.758
- [Narrator] And a good stink
all starts with a good brine.

00:01:13.927 --> 00:01:16.760
(water splashing)

00:01:44.197 --> 00:01:48.364
- [Narrator] And for Ms. Wu,
it's not only about the taste.

00:02:08.046 --> 00:02:12.213
- [Narrator] But for most of
Taiwan, it's about the taste.

00:02:23.699 --> 00:02:25.000
- [Narrator] Moral of the story,

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.667
don't judge a dish by its stink.

